# Macabre Reconstruction: the discount counts creature cards put into *your* graveyard (CR 700.4, 118.7), not an opponent's. On turn 3 Bot1 Bolts Bot2's Memnite, which goes to Bot2's graveyard: Macabre Reconstruction still costs
# {3}{B}, so Bot1's three remaining mana (two Mox Jets and an Island) can't pay for it (refused); with a second Island it is cast, with no target at all ("up to two" allows none, CR 115.1) and it returns nothing.

